  description: 'Strike once for 130% (Max 156%) of a normal attack. The hit is always
    a critical hit (your crit damage applies) and can''t be evaded. It is your normal
    attack for this turn (you don''t attack again), so lifesteal and on-hit effects
    work. Mana cost: 100.'
